:: Deadwood Whitney School Widgets [widget]
<!-- 只在原版后院普通菜单开放。每日记录沿用原版 daily.whitney，不添加读档或刷新监听。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-whitney-school-ready'>><<silently>>
  <<set _whitneySchoolReady to !!maplebirch.get('Whitney') and C.npc.Whitney.init is 1
    and ['active', 'rescued'].includes(C.npc.Whitney.state) and C.npc.Whitney.love gte 20
    and $whitneyReunionScene is undefined and Time.schoolDay and Time.hour is 12 and Time.minute lt (_args[0] ? 60 : 55)
    and $location is 'school_rear_courtyard' and $outside is 1 and $exposed lte 0
    and Weather.precipitation is 'none' and !Weather.isSnow and !pcAreArmsBound('both')
    and !$daily.whitney.ball and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$combat
    and !$statFreeze and !$replayScene and !$frozenValues and !$eventforced>>
<</silently>><</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-whitney-school-link'>>
  <<deadwood-whitney-school-ready>>
  <<set $_menu to document.querySelector('#passage-content a[data-passage="Hallways"]')>>
  <<if _whitneySchoolReady and $_menu>>
    <<icon 'whitney/courtyard-football.png'>><<lanLink ["Join Whitney's game", '看看惠特尼在玩什么'] 'Deadwood Whitney School'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-whitney-school-play'>><<silently>>
  <<set $_choice to _args[0]>>
  <<deadwood-whitney-school-ready>>
  <<if _whitneySchoolReady and ['play', 'score'].includes($_choice)>>
    <<pass 5>>
    <<deadwood-whitney-school-ready true>>
    <<if _whitneySchoolReady>>
      <<set $daily.whitney.ball to $_choice>>
      <<npcincr Whitney love 1>>
      <<if $_choice is 'play'>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</silently>><</widget>>

:: Deadwood Whitney School
<<set $location to 'school_rear_courtyard'>><<set $outside to 1>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck or $combat>><<exit>><</if>>
<<deadwood-whitney-school-ready>>
<<if $daily.whitney.ball and C.npc.Whitney.init is 1 and ['active', 'rescued'].includes(C.npc.Whitney.state)>>
  <<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $daily.whitney.ball is 'play'>>
        You join the game. Whitney kicks the ball straight at you, grinning when you scramble to meet it.
        <<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 14000>>You send it back between <<his>> friends. "Lucky shot," <<he>> says, already chasing it.<br><br>
        <<else>>The ball skips past your foot. Someone laughs, but Whitney sends it back your way. "Try using your feet this time."<br><br><</if>>
        When you step out, <<he>> wipes <<his>> forehead on <<his>> sleeve. "Not bad. Don't let it go to your head."
      <<else>>
        You keep score from the edge of the game. Whitney tries to claim an extra point, then looks at you when the others object.
        You give the correct score. "Traitor," <<he>> says, kicking the ball back into play. <<He>> keeps checking that you're watching.
      <</if>>
      <<if isLoveInterest('Whitney')>><br><br>On <<his>> way past, <<he>> catches your hand and pulls you close. "You're coming with me." <<He>> tells <<his>> friends to carry on without <<him>>.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $daily.whitney.ball is 'play'>>
        你加入了球局。惠特尼迎面把球踢过来，看着你急忙上前接球，咧嘴笑了。
        <<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 14000>>你把球从<<his>>朋友之间踢了回去。“运气不错。”<<he>>说着，已经追了上去。<br><br>
        <<else>>球擦着你的脚边滚过。有人笑出声，惠特尼却又把球传了回来。“这回记得用脚。”<br><br><</if>>
        你退出球局时，<<he>>用袖口擦了擦额头。“还行。别太得意。”
      <<else>>
        你站在边上计分。惠特尼想多算一分，其他人不服，<<he>>便转头看你。
        你报出了正确的分数。“叛徒。”<<he>>说着，把球踢回场中。之后<<he>>不时朝你这边看，确认你还在看球。
      <</if>>
      <<if isLoveInterest('Whitney')>><br><br>从你身旁经过时，<<he>>握住你的手，把你拉到身边。“你跟我走。”<<He>>叫朋友们自己接着玩。<</if>>
  <</language>><<lstress>><<glove>><<if $daily.whitney.ball is 'play'>><<gtiredness>><</if>>
<<elseif _whitneySchoolReady>>
  <<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Whitney and <<his>> friends have set their bags down as goalposts. <<He>> stops the ball under <<his>> shoe when <<he>> sees you.
      "Oi. We're one short." <<He>> rolls it towards you. "Unless you're scared of losing."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      惠特尼和<<his>>朋友把书包摆成了球门。看见你时，<<he>>一脚踩住球。
      “喂，缺个人。”<<He>>把球拨向你。“还是说，你怕输？”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<lanLink ['Join the game (0:05)', '加入球局 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Whitney School'>><<deadwood-whitney-school-play 'play'>><</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>><<gtiredness>><br>
  <<lanLink ['Keep score (0:05)', '留在边上计分 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Whitney School'>><<deadwood-whitney-school-play 'score'>><</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The game has broken up. You hear students making their way back into the school.' '球局已经散了。学生们正陆续往教学楼走。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the courtyard', '返回后院'] 'School Rear Courtyard'>><</lanLink>>
